WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:02.293
Eyes on the target.

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:04.879
She’s with a local
and that Resistance Agent.

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:06.381
I want the woman alive...

00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:08.049
The other two dead.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.802
Do whatever’s necessary.

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:11.720
Roger!

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:24.983
The hell?

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:30.280
Get up!

00:00:32.657 --> 00:00:34.242
-Grab the girl!
-Right away!

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:37.829
I see the Agent at three o’clock. Get him!

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:39.748
-Don't let the target escape!
-I got you!

00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:47.756
Control Field established.

00:01:33.468 --> 00:01:34.511
How’s he doing that?

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:40.100
He’s a Sensitive.

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:45.063
Let’s go.

00:02:02.747 --> 00:02:07.377
Welcome back, Agent.
I was getting worried about you.

